# About This Branch

This branch of the Teacup_Firmware fork is maintained by MorrieG for personal learning purposes. Its primary goal is to help me understand how RepRap firmware works and to provide insights into C++ coding.

**Warning:** The code in this branch is experimental and should not be relied upon for any purpose, including production or safety-critical use.

## License
This branch retains the original project's LICENSE file. All changes and additions are subject to the original license terms. See the LICENSE file for details.

## File Modifications
Where significant changes are made, a header comment is added to the top of the file, e.g.:

```c
// Modified by MorrieG for personal learning, 2025.
// See README.branch for details. Original license applies.
```

## Original Documentation
The original README and documentation files are retained for reference.
